  "notes": [
    "-AR verb with orthographic spelling change: c→qu before *e* (piqué, pique, piquemos, piquen)",
    "Past participle: *picado*",
    "Multiple meanings: (1) to sting/bite (*Me picó una abeja* — A bee stung me); (2) to snack (*picar entre horas* — to snack between meals); (3) to chop (*picar cebolla* — to chop onion); (4) to itch (*Me pica la espalda* — My back itches); (5) of food: to be spicy (*Este plato pica mucho* — This dish is very spicy)",
    "*picante* (adjective) = spicy; *el picoteo* = nibbles/snacks"
  ],
